  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthen the Social Assessment Capacity in Urban Construction Project in China</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&quot;Facing the fast urbanization development in China, the Ministry of Housing and Urban-Rural Construction is developing &quot;&quot;The Urban Construction Projects Social Assessment Guidelines&quot;&quot;. The Guidelines aims to regulate and provide instructions to social assessment work in urban construction projects and make social assessment play a more important part in the decision-making process. The primary assessment conducted by the Ministry found the capacity of various levels of government and consultants to implement the Guidelines is low. This IDF grant will assist the Ministry in strengthening social assessment capacity through: developing of Illustrated Guidelines, training for various levels of officials and consultants and planning for implementation monitoring mechanism.  The IDF grant aims to assist the Ministry of Housing and Urban-Rural Construction in strengthening social assessment capacity for urban construction projects in China. Specifically, the grant will assist the Ministry of Housing and Urban-Rural Construction in 1) developing and publishing of an Illustrated Social Assessment Guidelines on Urban Construction Projects;  2) designing and implementation related training programs;  and 3) recommending  institutional mechanism to integrate Social Assessment into project lifecycle.&quot;</narrative>
  </description>
